+// SIF RPC packets are runtime-owned guest RAM: 64 KiB at this base (default 0x1F00000 for fixtures).
+// The caller must keep it clear of every guest segment, heap and stack (the kernel arena is the place).
+void ps2SetRpcPacketPoolBase(uint32_t base);
+uint32_t ps2RpcPacketPoolBase();
+
 // Either range may be disabled independently by passing zero for both bounds.
 
 // Host-owned timing configuration, set once before PS2Runtime::initialize().
